Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:43.02,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0030,0035)}{\frz1.378\pos(544,460)}A{\fntangak}lchemistry
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.70,1:15:15.66,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(115,115)}{\pos(792,526)}D{\fs55}y{\fs}w
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:43.02,name,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0030, 0035)}{\pos(792,526)}D{\fs55}y{\fs}w
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:49.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.14,0:02:51.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Sana, Martini
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.14,0:02:53.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translators: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee, tommo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.38,0:01:00.51,memories,,0,0,0,,I forbid anyone to open this gate
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.68,0:01:08.68,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Stay where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.06,0:01:13.10,memories italics,,0,0,0,,You can’t just leave
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.69,0:01:15.40,memories,,0,0,0,,What about the child?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:19.28,memories,,0,0,0,,Think about what they will say about Do Hwa and that baby
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.82,0:01:21.65,memories,,0,0,0,,They will gossip that the son is not yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.53,0:01:24.99,memories,,0,0,0,,that he is illegitimate
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.74,0:01:29.45,memories,,0,0,0,,He will bear the surname Chan, since my wife gave birth to him
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.08,0:01:32.50,memories,,0,0,0,,I’ll send someone after him after the funeral
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.58,0:01:34.04,memories,,0,0,0,,Are you leaving him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.42,0:01:36.58,memories,,0,0,0,,He's true
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.38,0:01:38.88,memories,,0,0,0,,not your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.30,0:01:43.47,memories,,0,0,0,,Believe what you want
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.26,0:01:48.47,memories italics,,0,0,0,,If he’s nothing but problems,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.55,0:01:50.31,memories,,0,0,0,,let's get rid of him here and now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.02,0:02:02.48,memories,,0,0,0,,See? He is your son
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.57,0:02:07.41,memories,,0,0,0,,The son you want to protect even at the cost of your life
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.99,0:02:09.74,memories,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to keep him safe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.45,0:02:14.79,memories,,0,0,0,,If his gates of energy are not opened, and he lives like my son, he will survive
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.29,0:02:18.42,memories,,0,0,0,,But if he decides to try his luck,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:21.67,memories,,0,0,0,,death awaits him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.76,0:02:26.26,memories,,0,0,0,,Who is the father
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:28.84,memories,,0,0,0,,child?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.39,0:02:35.52,memories,,0,0,0,,His father is dead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.02,0:02:41.11,memories italics,,0,0,0,,His birth makes no sense, moreover,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.90,0:02:43.94,memories italics,,0,0,0,,he should not have been born at all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.45,0:02:51.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Young Master, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.45,0:02:54.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you release it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.91,0:02:56.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Let her go
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.07,0:03:27.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry for causing trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:29.41,italics,,0,0,0,,Why did you untie her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.28,0:03:35.12,general text,,0,0,0,,She tried to poison you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.70,0:03:37.70,general text,,0,0,0,,She didn’t try
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.91,0:03:40.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I drank the poison myself
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.96,0:03:46.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Because I was unable to cast spells
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.46,0:03:50.34,general text,,0,0,0,,My maid only did what she was told. At the cost of his life
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.64,0:03:53.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I ordered her
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.98,0:04:05.02,general text,,0,0,0,,- Chan Wook, how could you?\N- Wait with this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.11,0:04:08.90,general text,,0,0,0,,He has not fully recovered yet
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.99,0:04:12.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Punish him as you want, but after he recovers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.57,0:04:14.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk almost died
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.45,0:04:16.70,general text,,0,0,0,,No need to scold him
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.79,0:04:18.45,italics,,0,0,0,,He’s all pale
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:21.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Take him home bye
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.00,0:04:24.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Sir, let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.21,0:04:26.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Go to Sejukwon, you will be cured there
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:27.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok needs to go there too
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.21,0:04:29.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Now is not the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.88,0:04:31.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok also needs treatment
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.88,0:04:33.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Otherwise I won’t go
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.55,0:04:34.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.85,0:04:36.93,italics,,0,0,0,,Well, great! Die then
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.01,0:04:39.89,general text,,0,0,0,,- Lock them up again!\N- Uncle, calm down
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.98,0:04:42.06,general text,,0,0,0,,If Uk is telling the truth, she is not guilty
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:44.02,general text,,0,0,0,,She is seriously wounded
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.69,0:04:46.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Without treatment she will die
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.36,0:04:49.61,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised she's still alive after all the beatings
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.19,0:04:52.91,general text,,0,0,0,,If she dies, I will let you conduct her funeral
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.46,0:05:11.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Please help
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:16.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok risked her life following my order
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.51,0:05:19.10,general text,,0,0,0,,She must be taken to Sejukwon, otherwise she will not survive
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.85,0:05:22.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Help her
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.15,0:05:34.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Get them out of my sight
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.45,0:05:37.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Take them to Saejukwon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.62,0:05:41.54,italics,,0,0,0,,Ukrainian...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.21,0:05:47.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Young master, go. I'll bring Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:48.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.75,0:05:51.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, wake up
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.03,0:06:13.53,general text,,0,0,0,,- I’ll carry her\N- No
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.99,0:06:16.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Myself
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.49,0:06:17.95,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t even stand on your feet
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.82,0:06:21.70,general text,,0,0,0,,I can do it. She's my maid, I'll carry her myself
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.79,0:06:23.41,general text,,0,0,0,,You can barely walk yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.50,0:06:25.16,general text,,0,0,0,,You can’t get it there
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.12,0:06:29.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think? Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:32.84,general text,,0,0,0,,- You will carry her on your back\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.92,0:06:34.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.84,0:06:36.80,general text,,0,0,0,,- Do you want me to carry her?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:39.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.18,0:06:40.68,general text,,0,0,0,,- Come here\N- Young Master
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.18,0:06:43.35,general text,,0,0,0,,No. Wait. Heaven...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.93,0:06:45.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Holy heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.14,0:06:48.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yul. Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.48,0:06:50.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Carry me instead of Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.19,0:06:54.74,general text,,0,0,0,,No strength at all. Take me to Sejukwon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.49,0:06:57.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to carry him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.74,0:07:02.28,general text,,0,0,0,,- No\N- Okay, thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.37,0:07:04.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Servant Kim, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.20,0:07:05.75,general text,,0,0,0,,- Be careful with her\N- Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.83,0:07:06.71,general text,,0,0,0,,- Well...\N- What...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:08.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Caution
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.09,0:07:13.63,general text,,0,0,0,,In the end, UK
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.09,0:07:17.63,general text,,0,0,0,,opened the gates of energy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.84,0:07:19.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.26,0:07:25.85,general text,,0,0,0,,He risked his life. I couldn't just sit and watch
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:29.44,general text,,0,0,0,,I think he understood,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.52,0:07:33.07,general text,,0,0,0,,that we will not let him kill himself
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.94,0:07:36.53,italics,,0,0,0,,He probably drank the poison himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.61,0:07:38.28,general text,,0,0,0,,so that we save him
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:43.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.87,0:07:48.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Opening the gates of Uka and his treatment
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:51.63,general text,,0,0,0,,probably costs me ten years of energy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.67,0:07:56.80,general text,,0,0,0,,So you not only opened his gates, but also gave him energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.88,0:08:00.43,general text,,0,0,0,,What should I, an old man, store my energy for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.13,0:08:03.14,general text,,0,0,0,,He was poisoned,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.22,0:08:05.85,general text,,0,0,0,,so I gave him the strength to recover quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.93,0:08:09.85,general text,,0,0,0,,When Uk is restored, you must return them
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.81,0:08:14.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this really necessary when his gates are open?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.73,0:08:18.40,general text,,0,0,0,,He was 20 years late in learning spells
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.49,0:08:20.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Even if he starts studying now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.41,0:08:25.74,general text,,0,0,0,,learn something worthwhile by age 60
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.83,0:08:28.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Such is his fate
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:32.04,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to make sure of this
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.79,0:08:37.09,general text,,0,0,0,,If you want it, I'll take your powers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.17,0:08:38.30,general text,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.17,0:08:41.88,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm too tired. I want to relax
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.63,0:08:44.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Bring me wine
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.64,0:08:49.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.06,0:08:53.10,general text,,0,0,0,,That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.94,0:08:57.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Where does the wine come from in the practice hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.57,0:08:58.82,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.82,0:09:02.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw that you stuck it in yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.70,0:09:05.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Come on. The wine you drink when you're lonely
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.12,0:09:08.54,general text,,0,0,0,,- I’m not alone!\N- That’s right
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.87,0:09:11.83,italics,,0,0,0,,I’m completely...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.91,0:09:13.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Head hurts
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:15.04,general text,,0,0,0,,This is because...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.13,0:09:16.71,general text,,0,0,0,,What was it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.79,0:09:18.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly. Insomnia
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.92,0:09:20.71,general text,,0,0,0,,I have terrible insomnia
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.97,0:09:24.68,general text,,0,0,0,,I drink wine for insomnia
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.89,0:09:34.48,italics,,0,0,0,,Loneliness keeps you from sleeping
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.56,0:09:36.86,general text,,0,0,0,,You should have married in your youth
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.65,0:09:42.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten Do Hwa yet? So lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.33,0:09:55.42,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s empty
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.29,0:09:57.46,general text,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- You drank it all
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.88,0:10:01.25,general text,,0,0,0,,It cannot be. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.34,0:10:06.51,general text,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.59,0:10:09.22,general text,,0,0,0,,I think you were incredibly lonely
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.30,0:10:12.35,general text,,0,0,0,,I only drank one glass when I couldn’t sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.97,0:10:14.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Only one glass each time...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.32,0:10:24.78,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the wine that my uncle hid in his place
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.86,0:10:26.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Tastes pleasant
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:30.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Finally, Uka’s lifelong dream has come true
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.78,0:10:32.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's celebrate
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.54,0:10:34.20,general text,,0,0,0,,That girl, Mu Dok...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.29,0:10:36.33,general text,,0,0,0,,He recently brought her from the gisaeng house, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.13,0:10:41.34,general text,,0,0,0,,She risked her life for him, despite the fact that they had just met
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.59,0:10:44.63,general text,,0,0,0,,This is strange
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.71,0:10:47.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk saved her from the fate of becoming a kisaeng
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.63,0:10:50.93,general text,,0,0,0,,She didn’t want it so much that she pretended to be blind
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.01,0:10:52.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Drink
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.76,0:10:53.97,general text,,0,0,0,,"Blind"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.64,0:10:58.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. According to Joo Wol, she was blind when she arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.19,0:11:00.06,general text,,0,0,0,,and as soon as I left there, I immediately saw the light
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.15,0:11:02.07,general text,,0,0,0,,The wine is wonderful
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.94,0:11:05.36,general text,,0,0,0,,She easily deceives people
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:09.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Lied that she was blind and that Uka poisoned
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.95,0:11:13.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Silent, despite torture
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:15.45,italics,,0,0,0,,There is more to her than meets the eye
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:18.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Outwardly, she is a sweet and naive girl
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.17,0:11:20.42,general text,,0,0,0,,But she is clearly hiding something
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.17,0:11:29.80,general text,,0,0,0,,- You drank it all\N- What? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.18,0:11:33.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Your uncle is coming here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.64,0:11:35.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I think you're doomed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.22,0:11:38.77,general text,,0,0,0,,- I didn’t drink anything\N- Wait, Yul
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.85,0:11:39.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.69,0:11:44.07,general text,,0,0,0,,- Mommies\N- Dan Gu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.15,0:11:47.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm done
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:50.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Park Dan Gu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.49,0:11:53.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.33,0:11:55.24,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:01.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Come here
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.67,0:12:04.54,general text,,0,0,0,,- Dan Gu\N- Yes, uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.18,0:12:15.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Is she breathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:22.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Woke up
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.52,0:12:25.90,general text,,0,0,0,,You didn’t come to your senses, I thought you might die
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.82,0:12:34.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:37.24,general text,,0,0,0,,I think my bones are broken
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.83,0:12:39.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Nothing is broken
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.12,0:12:41.71,general text,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.25,0:12:44.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Then why does it hurt so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.71,0:12:46.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Useless body
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.09,0:12:49.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.30,0:12:53.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you say you poisoned me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.30,0:12:56.64,general text,,0,0,0,,If you pretended that you didn’t know anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.72,0:12:58.47,general text,,0,0,0,,you wouldn’t be tortured
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.02,0:13:02.39,general text,,0,0,0,,So that they believe that you are dying
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.94,0:13:05.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Otherwise they would not have opened your gates
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.19,0:13:08.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Let’s make an antidote
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.57,0:13:11.61,general text,,0,0,0,,So you really risked your life
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.86,0:13:17.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought they would cut off my arm or leg
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.28,0:13:19.95,general text,,0,0,0,,But I'm fine
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:22.46,general text,,0,0,0,,People of Sosnovy Bor are too kind
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.54,0:13:24.33,general text,,0,0,0,,If they torture people like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.34,0:13:28.42,general text,,0,0,0,,And you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.25,0:13:31.72,general text,,0,0,0,,You look rather sickly
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.22,0:13:33.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:37.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Obviously, to take care of you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.97,0:13:40.18,general text,,0,0,0,,All students here are magicians
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.27,0:13:41.85,general text,,0,0,0,,They shouldn’t know about you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.43,0:13:46.02,general text,,0,0,0,,So I closed the door while no one saw,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.10,0:13:49.61,general text,,0,0,0,,changed your clothes, applied ointment to your wounds
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.69,0:13:52.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Even did a massage when you lost consciousness
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.45,0:13:55.74,general text,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.16,0:14:03.96,general text,,0,0,0,,You can only let me get so close to you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.07,0:14:36.32,general text,,0,0,0,,For my entire life
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:40.08,general text,,0,0,0,,no one understood how desperate I was
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.95,0:14:44.91,general text,,0,0,0,,And no one risked their life for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:47.42,general text,,0,0,0,,except you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.76,0:15:03.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Since I survived, as promised,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:06.18,general text,,0,0,0,,I will treat you like a master
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.32,0:15:16.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I have already changed 12 masters
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.45,0:15:20.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone thinks that the teachers abandoned me, but it was me who left
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:25.87,general text,,0,0,0,,And now I have found a true teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.45,0:15:28.87,general text,,0,0,0,,So I must kneel
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.96,0:15:31.21,general text,,0,0,0,,and swear that I will always treat you like a teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:34.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Under one condition
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.42,0:15:40.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t tell anyone about our relationship
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.01,0:15:42.97,general text,,0,0,0,,You will remain my master,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.26,0:15:46.22,general text,,0,0,0,,and I am your servant
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.81,0:15:50.90,general text,,0,0,0,,And also,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.65,0:15:55.73,general text,,0,0,0,,our master-student relationship will last until you become the best
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.82,0:15:58.19,general text,,0,0,0,,and help me get my energy back
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.28,0:16:01.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Until then
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.03,0:16:05.99,general text,,0,0,0,,When I get my power back and become Nak Su,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:10.54,general text,,0,0,0,,we will not be master and student
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.58,0:16:13.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.84,0:16:18.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Then
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.09,0:16:21.47,general text,,0,0,0,,you won’t have to protect me anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.51,0:16:24.35,general text,,0,0,0,,and I don’t have to be
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.64,0:16:29.06,general text,,0,0,0,,soft with you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.07,0:16:40.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to leave me when it’s all over?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.36,0:16:42.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.33,0:16:46.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:49.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Abandon me when you no longer need me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.95,0:16:52.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I will respect your decision and let you go
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.09,0:17:01.55,general text,,0,0,0,,And now kneel before the master
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.77,0:17:10.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I, Chan Wook, your student,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.81,0:17:13.69,general text,,0,0,0,,I will serve and protect my master Mu Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.39,0:18:35.52,general text,,0,0,0,,You have returned your appearance
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.15,0:18:45.40,general text,,0,0,0,,You won’t go wild for a while
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.95,0:18:49.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Then we'll meet at the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.46,0:19:01.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Feed the soul swallower with human souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.13,0:19:03.13,general text,,0,0,0,,so that it is useful
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.30,0:19:08.22,general text,,0,0,0,,You killed the gisaeng into whose body Nak Soo fled
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.30,0:19:10.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. We dumped the body in Gyeongjeongdaeho Lake
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.85,0:19:12.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Checked for the blue mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.23,0:19:19.77,memories,,0,0,0,,No tags
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.15,0:19:22.57,memories,,0,0,0,,This is not Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.53,0:19:26.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, checked
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.78,0:19:30.24,general text,,0,0,0,,The Nak Su that I knew would not lose to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.91,0:19:33.62,general text,,0,0,0,,but it apparently lost its power
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.16,0:19:37.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Can nomads lose strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.58,0:19:39.87,general text,,0,0,0,,If a strong soul
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.96,0:19:44.42,general text,,0,0,0,,falls into the wrong body and cannot access its power
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.50,0:19:46.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you seen this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.26,0:19:56.43,memories,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.52,0:19:58.27,memories,,0,0,0,,I am Jin Mu, Master Chan's student
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.35,0:20:00.19,memories,,0,0,0,,Heard you asked me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.57,0:20:11.57,memories,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.49,0:20:13.57,memories,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.66,0:20:16.79,memories,,0,0,0,,I am not a king. It's me, Chang Gang
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.50,0:20:20.29,memories,,0,0,0,,The soul of the king is now in my body
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.38,0:20:33.01,memories,,0,0,0,,Master, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.09,0:20:36.56,memories,,0,0,0,,Yes, the king and I switched bodies
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.18,0:20:39.02,memories,,0,0,0,,Then where is His Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.10,0:20:40.89,memories,,0,0,0,,His soul is in my body
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.48,0:20:43.56,memories,,0,0,0,,I have to get my body back
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.15,0:20:46.65,memories,,0,0,0,,But I can’t use my power
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.73,0:20:49.49,memories,,0,0,0,,I need your help
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.20,0:20:52.28,memories,,0,0,0,,Master
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.82,0:20:55.74,memories,,0,0,0,,I don’t know how soul alchemy works
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.58,0:21:00.58,memories,,0,0,0,,Go to the secret hall of Jeonbugwan and bring back the Soul Reflector
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.08,0:21:04.21,memories,,0,0,0,,I will teach you the alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.92,0:21:10.01,offscreen,,0,0,0,,He could not regain his strength due to his weak body,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.09,0:21:12.09,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,so I got a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.55,0:21:15.05,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,I'm lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.47,0:21:19.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Burn all these bodies
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.28,0:21:43.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Search the kisaeng house where the murdered woman worked
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.71,0:21:46.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Find the owner of the spirit amulet
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.21,0:21:48.71,general text,,0,0,0,,The main thing is unnoticeable
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.34,0:21:50.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.14,0:22:06.48,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.56,0:22:09.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Cold
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.27,0:22:12.24,general text,,0,0,0,,The water is absolutely icy
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.32,0:22:15.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course, it’s cold. Why are you sitting there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.57,0:22:20.08,general text,,0,0,0,,For the first time I feel such cold
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.74,0:22:23.91,general text,,0,0,0,,I used to lose consciousness because the energy gate was closed
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.00,0:22:26.21,general text,,0,0,0,,And now, even though I’m shaking, I can stand
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.29,0:22:28.96,general text,,0,0,0,,So my gates are indeed open
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.04,0:22:31.46,general text,,0,0,0,,If you master the spells, it won’t be cold even on ice
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.55,0:22:33.01,general text,,0,0,0,,And the fire will not burn
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.71,0:22:35.97,general text,,0,0,0,,What were you like before you changed your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.05,0:22:38.47,general text,,0,0,0,,There were a lot of rumors about you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.26,0:22:40.56,general text,,0,0,0,,But I've never seen you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.64,0:22:42.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you were strong
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.35,0:22:48.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Not just strong, but very strong
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.40,0:22:51.02,general text,,0,0,0,,"Very"? I see
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.11,0:22:54.65,general text,,0,0,0,,To become the best magician, you need to go through several stages
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.74,0:22:59.32,general text,,0,0,0,,First to Chipsu, the ability to use water energy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.16,0:23:08.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Second step - Ryusu, ability to control the energy of water flow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.75,0:23:11.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Then Chisu - control of water energy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.09,0:23:15.21,general text,,0,0,0,,in the atmosphere
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.92,0:23:19.39,general text,,0,0,0,,I have mastered all three stages
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.47,0:23:22.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Few people in Deho are capable of this
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.72,0:23:25.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Master, you live up to your name
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:27.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.52,0:23:30.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I moved silently, like a shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.48,0:23:35.44,general text,,0,0,0,,and the heads of my enemies fell to the ground as I passed by
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.15,0:23:37.70,general text,,0,0,0,,I was Nak Su,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.95,0:23:40.53,general text,,0,0,0,,shadow warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.42,0:23:55.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I walked on water as if I was flying
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.38,0:23:58.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Where I go - the wind rose
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.32,0:24:19.86,general text,,0,0,0,,And I’ll do this - it was raining
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.74,0:24:27.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I am Nak Su, the best magician in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.04,0:24:31.04,general text,,0,0,0,,which can create snow and rain
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.09,0:24:36.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.59,0:24:40.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Just a couple of movements,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.88,0:24:43.93,general text,,0,0,0,,and my lungs are ready to explode
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.81,0:24:49.73,general text,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.81,0:24:51.89,general text,,0,0,0,,My leg cramped!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.98,0:24:52.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Convulsion?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.02,0:24:56.23,general text,,0,0,0,,These legs are short, thin, weak and cannot stand the cold
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.02,0:24:58.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Useless body
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.90,0:25:04.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Be careful. You are no longer Nak Soo, the shadow warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.82,0:25:06.87,general text,,0,0,0,,You are Mu Dok, my maid
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.95,0:25:10.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t jump around like you are now
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.75,0:25:11.75,general text,,0,0,0,,You'll get hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.12,0:25:14.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I feel like an insignificance
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.63,0:25:20.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t be sad. You have me
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.84,0:25:23.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's start training, my gates are open
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.88,0:25:26.14,general text,,0,0,0,,But first, put on your shoes. It's cold
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.28,0:25:42.65,general text,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.24,0:25:44.53,general text,,0,0,0,,No agility
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.91,0:25:46.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Select
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.16,0:25:51.29,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.29,0:25:55.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's see how good my student is, then I will forget about sadness
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.79,0:25:56.96,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.35,0:26:11.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Why beat?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.72,0:26:13.73,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t wield a sword
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.23,0:26:15.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Show me how you fight
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.66,0:26:32.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Here is a small one...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.25,0:26:34.29,general text,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.80,0:26:48.34,general text,,0,0,0,,You fight badly too
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.05,0:26:52.56,general text,,0,0,0,,You're worse than I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.64,0:26:55.48,general text,,0,0,0,,I never really studied!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.65,0:27:01.61,general text,,0,0,0,,You had 12 teachers
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.23,0:27:04.69,general text,,0,0,0,,You haven’t learned how to cast spells,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.78,0:27:08.16,general text,,0,0,0,,but could master martial arts
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.24,0:27:10.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t have the mood for it
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.49,0:27:11.49,general text,,0,0,0,,As you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.58,0:27:13.83,general text,,0,0,0,,I need to tune in to do something
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.66,0:27:15.83,general text,,0,0,0,,You're just lazy
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.33,0:27:20.08,general text,,0,0,0,,I noticed that you don’t do anything at home
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.17,0:27:22.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, I learned everything by heart. Check
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.38,0:27:24.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think I recognized you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.09,0:27:26.59,general text,,0,0,0,,I realized that you are using the Tansu style
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.09,0:27:28.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Only chatter
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.43,0:27:29.93,general text,,0,0,0,,I can do more than just chat
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.76,0:27:34.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Have you seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.72,0:27:36.35,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm a fast learner
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.43,0:27:39.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I will quickly master Chipsa. How long does it take?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.40,0:27:41.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I also learn quickly, but it took me five years
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.61,0:27:43.40,general text,,0,0,0,,And for others - 20 years
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.48,0:27:44.61,general text,,0,0,0,,And you...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.15,0:27:48.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe you’ll master it even faster,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.78,0:27:50.16,general text,,0,0,0,,since you are the son of Chang Gang
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.20,0:27:53.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Which side is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.20,0:27:56.08,general text,,0,0,0,,He is a genius who mastered Chips in a year
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.79,0:27:58.08,general text,,0,0,0,,You will master Chips in a year,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.16,0:28:00.75,general text,,0,0,0,,rumors that you are not his son will subside
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.83,0:28:02.96,general text,,0,0,0,,But, of course, this is hardly possible
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.46,0:28:05.63,general text,,0,0,0,,If it took him a year, I’ll master it in six months
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.71,0:28:07.59,general text,,0,0,0,,No, in three months
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.17,0:28:09.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Talking again
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.09,0:28:12.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I am determined, don’t knock me down
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.93,0:28:18.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Maid Kim told me to sweep the whole yard
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.68,0:28:20.19,general text,,0,0,0,,You've gotten better,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.27,0:28:23.19,general text,,0,0,0,,and you’re doing well, so help me
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.15,0:28:27.03,general text,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.82,0:28:30.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.20,0:28:34.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm a lazy person who doesn't do anything without the appropriate attitude
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.45,0:28:37.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Good luck
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.83,0:28:39.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Bastard...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.00,0:28:42.08,general text,,0,0,0,,- Wow...\N- So cool
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.17,0:28:44.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Useless lazy fellow!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.59,0:28:47.80,general text,,0,0,0,,So cool, even cold
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.13,0:28:57.06,italics,,0,0,0,,Master Ho made medicine for Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.60,0:28:59.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently it is very effective
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.27,0:29:03.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Especially when his gates are open
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.19,0:29:08.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Servant Kim, you seem to be very pleased
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.94,0:29:13.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you so upset that his gates are open?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.12,0:29:18.24,general text,,0,0,0,,You did nothing, even when he was dying
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.33,0:29:23.12,general text,,0,0,0,,If it weren’t for Master Huo, the young master could have died
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.21,0:29:27.04,general text,,0,0,0,,He had to find a way to save him without opening the gate
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.13,0:29:28.38,general text,,0,0,0,,How harmful you are
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.17,0:29:32.05,general text,,0,0,0,,You always kept your distance from the young master
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.13,0:29:33.13,general text,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.22,0:29:35.47,general text,,0,0,0,,because of rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.43,0:29:43.39,general text,,0,0,0,,What rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.48,0:29:44.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t pretend you don’t know
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.52,0:29:47.52,general text,,0,0,0,,You know that there are rumors,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.61,0:29:50.90,general text,,0,0,0,,that you are the father of Mr. Chan
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.36,0:29:54.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t you dare mention
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.74,0:29:58.78,general text,,0,0,0,,such absurd rumors!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.70,0:30:01.50,general text,,0,0,0,,They are not so absurd
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.58,0:30:04.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's be honest, we both know
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.79,0:30:07.63,general text,,0,0,0,,that you loved Mrs. Do Hwa before her marriage
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.21,0:30:11.92,general text,,0,0,0,,You wrote her poems and gave her gifts
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.01,0:30:13.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I am a living witness
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.92,0:30:17.22,general text,,0,0,0,,They say that you still haven’t gotten married because you haven’t forgotten her
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.10,0:30:19.56,general text,,0,0,0,,What about you, maid Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.22,0:30:22.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you still in love with Chang Gang?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.52,0:30:27.23,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s why you didn’t get married and live in his house?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.86,0:30:28.69,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.77,0:30:32.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I know how much you liked him
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.07,0:30:36.11,general text,,0,0,0,,When he told you he liked acorn jelly,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.20,0:30:37.95,general text,,0,0,0,,you climbed to the top of the mountain, like a squirrel,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.03,0:30:39.95,general text,,0,0,0,,- to collect acorns\N- Squirrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.03,0:30:42.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw you collecting acorns
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.54,0:30:47.54,general text,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.58,0:30:52.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you laughing at the fact that I went to collect acorns?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.13,0:30:56.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.93,0:30:59.43,general text,,0,0,0,,I admit that I went to collect them
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.01,0:31:03.85,general text,,0,0,0,,I could express my feelings only by preparing this jelly
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.73,0:31:07.06,general text,,0,0,0,,You can laugh at me as much as you want
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.40,0:31:15.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm not laughing
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.45,0:31:19.62,general text,,0,0,0,,When I saw you making this jelly,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.53,0:31:22.83,general text,,0,0,0,,I felt sad
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.37,0:31:27.08,italics,,0,0,0,,I know how it feels,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.71,0:31:30.79,italics,,0,0,0,,when you can’t do anything
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.54,0:31:32.80,general text,,0,0,0,,for the person you love
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.17,0:31:36.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Others
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.97,0:31:39.55,general text,,0,0,0,,they can slander us behind our backs
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.22,0:31:43.64,general text,,0,0,0,,But let's not do this to each other
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.23,0:31:49.56,general text,,0,0,0,,It is obvious that the love we felt
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.81,0:31:53.40,italics,,0,0,0,,when we were young,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.98,0:31:56.90,general text,,0,0,0,,in the end left a scar in our hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.87,0:32:05.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I was on edge because of Mr. Chan
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.16,0:32:08.25,general text,,0,0,0,,and said too much
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.33,0:32:09.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Forgive me
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.08,0:32:13.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm very worried about Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.00,0:32:17.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm just afraid that by opening the gates of energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.67,0:32:22.30,general text,,0,0,0,,we could break the barrier that protected him
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.39,0:32:24.47,italics,,0,0,0,,I feel uneasy about this
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.56,0:32:27.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I may have to suppress his will
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.81,0:32:32.44,general text,,0,0,0,,and stop in the future
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.90,0:32:37.28,general text,,0,0,0,,I ask you not to despise me for this
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.70,0:32:40.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's see how everything turns out
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.87,0:32:51.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Sir, this is wild ginseng tea
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.17,0:32:53.46,italics,,0,0,0,,Drink it
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.54,0:32:54.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Wild ginseng?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.29,0:32:57.00,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll have a drink when I get back. Leave it here
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.09,0:32:58.26,general text,,0,0,0,,You again
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.84,0:33:00.42,general text,,0,0,0,,do you want to give it to Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.01,0:33:03.64,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s cold outside. She deserves something warm and nice
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.47,0:33:07.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you make her sweep the yard in such cold weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.35,0:33:09.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Listen
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.31,0:33:12.60,general text,,0,0,0,,This maid was cured for free
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.69,0:33:14.61,general text,,0,0,0,,So I asked her to do at least something in response
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.69,0:33:17.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Why her? Couldn't you do it yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.65,0:33:21.53,general text,,0,0,0,,I needed to brew some medicine for you, cook dinner
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.61,0:33:22.74,general text,,0,0,0,,and take care of you
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.82,0:33:25.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok will take care of me. You don't need to worry
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.45,0:33:29.70,italics,,0,0,0,,Clear
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.79,0:33:32.00,general text,,0,0,0,,You’re only worried about Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.50,0:33:35.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Since I became useless,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.17,0:33:38.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll go sweep the yard like Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.76,0:33:46.39,general text,,0,0,0,,I just think I've put too much on you
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.47,0:33:49.56,general text,,0,0,0,,How long did you brew this wild ginseng?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.64,0:33:51.52,general text,,0,0,0,,I cooked it all day
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.60,0:33:54.14,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s what I’m talking about. You couldn't even close your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.23,0:33:56.90,general text,,0,0,0,,How do you think this makes me feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.11,0:33:59.94,general text,,0,0,0,,- Not good\N- Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.03,0:34:03.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I know you've been through a lot because of me
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.82,0:34:08.91,general text,,0,0,0,,And he looks tired. You used to have porcelain skin
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.58,0:34:11.70,italics,,0,0,0,,You should drink wild ginseng tea
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.79,0:34:15.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe then you can stop getting into trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.12,0:34:16.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know what to tell the head
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.54,0:34:18.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I will accept his punishment
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.55,0:34:22.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Now my gates are open, which means I will become part of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.63,0:34:29.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you so happy that the gate is open?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.72,0:34:31.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, very
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.10,0:34:35.14,general text,,0,0,0,,When I enter Sosnovy Bor and become better Julia and Dan Gu,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.23,0:34:37.65,general text,,0,0,0,,they will regret not accepting me sooner
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.65,0:34:43.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim, you can eat this ginseng
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.28,0:34:46.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the ginseng, I really appreciate it
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.84,0:35:04.72,general text,,0,0,0,,You must be that evil servant
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.80,0:35:06.76,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? We gave you medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.84,0:35:08.01,general text,,0,0,0,,You can catch the disease
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.09,0:35:10.80,general text,,0,0,0,,I was cured for free,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.89,0:35:13.43,general text,,0,0,0,,so they said that I should work to show my gratitude
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.52,0:35:15.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim is a wise woman
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.06,0:35:19.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Sweep the yard, then bring fertilizer to the herb garden
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.02,0:35:21.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.32,0:35:23.57,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Just wait, Ho Yeom
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.65,0:35:26.03,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Now I'm sweeping your yard,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.11,0:35:27.99,offscreen,,0,0,0,,but one day I'll get rid of Saejukwon
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.49,0:35:33.54,italics,,0,0,0,,Hey! Watch where you're aiming
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.62,0:35:35.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you doing this on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.87,0:35:36.75,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.83,0:35:38.71,general text,,0,0,0,,And I think so
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.79,0:35:39.96,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare I
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.00,0:35:45.80,general text,,0,0,0,,You are very strange
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.59,0:35:47.84,italics,,0,0,0,,These ears...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.92,0:35:50.80,general text,,0,0,0,,I've seen them before
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.31,0:35:56.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Have I not treated you in the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.39,0:36:01.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Where do I get the money for treatment in Sejukwon?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.32,0:36:07.49,general text,,0,0,0,,These ears look familiar
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.78,0:36:14.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Sweep thoroughly
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.58,0:36:18.91,general text,,0,0,0,,He almost tore my ear off
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.75,0:36:21.29,italics,,0,0,0,,I know you're in pain, but just be patient
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.38,0:36:24.71,general text,,0,0,0,,He's angry at Mr. Chan, so he takes it out on you
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.80,0:36:28.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Bullying on the weak is normal, that’s how the world works
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.01,0:36:31.05,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll just be silent
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.13,0:36:33.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Try not to hate him
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.26,0:36:35.14,general text,,0,0,0,,He gave away the flow of energy that cost him ten years,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.22,0:36:37.18,general text,,0,0,0,,to help the young master recover faster
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.93,0:36:39.81,italics,,0,0,0,,Rest when you're done
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.69,0:36:45.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Energy flow of ten years?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.37,0:36:59.00,general text,,0,0,0,,What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.08,0:37:01.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Come, this is wild ginseng...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.12,0:37:03.21,general text,,0,0,0,,What is it, Mu Dok?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.29,0:37:05.00,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.88,0:37:07.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Hold still
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.92,0:37:09.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t bring you here for this
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.01,0:37:12.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, this is wrong. I'm your student, stop it
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.64,0:37:15.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Here you go
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.89,0:37:22.39,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.48,0:37:23.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Checking your energy core
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.90,0:37:27.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Breathe easy
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.96,0:37:45.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Here it is
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.96,0:37:48.25,general text,,0,0,0,,The truth is
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.50,0:37:51.01,general text,,0,0,0,,You really are special
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.67,0:37:52.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop it
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.51,0:37:55.39,general text,,0,0,0,,What is inside me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.47,0:37:56.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Incredible flow of energy
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.60,0:37:59.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Ho Yeom put energy into you
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.85,0:38:03.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.57,0:38:14.15,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems that Uk has already recovered
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.24,0:38:16.87,general text,,0,0,0,,It's time to extract the energy you put into it
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.95,0:38:20.04,general text,,0,0,0,,If everything goes wrong, he might lose his mind
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.74,0:38:23.58,general text,,0,0,0,,UK will not be able to use it
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.46,0:38:26.63,general text,,0,0,0,,The gates of his energy have just opened
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.71,0:38:29.13,general text,,0,0,0,,In essence, he can’t do anything
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.21,0:38:30.59,general text,,0,0,0,,You’re worrying in vain
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.25,0:38:35.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Most likely he doesn’t even know that there is something so incredible inside him
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.68,0:38:40.76,italics,,0,0,0,,Let's steal Ho Yeom's energy
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.85,0:38:46.31,general text,,0,0,0,,The core of your energy is filled with the energy that Ho Yeom gave you
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.27,0:38:49.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Now you are strong enough to easily use Chipsa
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.44,0:38:52.19,general text,,0,0,0,,I had no idea that there was something so valuable in me
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.28,0:38:55.57,general text,,0,0,0,,It takes ten years to collect such energy, and you got it for free
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.65,0:38:57.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Besides, this is the energy of Ho Yeom, you can’t ask for anything better
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.74,0:39:00.12,general text,,0,0,0,,You lucky fool
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.20,0:39:04.45,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought the old man hated me. I'm surprised he gave it to me
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.54,0:39:07.54,general text,,0,0,0,,He gave it to you to help you recover
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.62,0:39:08.88,general text,,0,0,0,,He will take her soon
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.96,0:39:12.34,general text,,0,0,0,,He can't do that. What's in my belly is mine
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.42,0:39:14.51,general text,,0,0,0,,If you don’t have the strength to control her,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.59,0:39:17.47,general text,,0,0,0,,your strength will not be and he will take it away
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.55,0:39:20.18,general text,,0,0,0,,I must learn to control the energy in order to keep it for myself
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.26,0:39:23.27,general text,,0,0,0,,So I have to breathe as a source of energy
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.06,0:39:27.10,general text,,0,0,0,,I guess these 12 teachers taught you at least something
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.19,0:39:29.27,general text,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.56,0:39:33.57,italics,,0,0,0,,Energy from the core is controlled by breathing,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.65,0:39:35.86,italics,,0,0,0,,however, all magicians breathe differently
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.94,0:39:39.61,italics,,0,0,0,,Everyone inhales and exhales different amounts of air
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.74,0:39:44.49,general text,,0,0,0,,This is Ho Yeom's energy, so you need to control it with his breathing
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.41,0:39:47.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I doubt that he will teach me
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.46,0:39:50.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should just try everything? It's just breathing
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.33,0:39:54.71,general text,,0,0,0,,If you use someone's breath, you can lose control and go crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.46,0:39:59.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Blood will spill from all parts of your body, and you will die
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.72,0:40:01.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, shall we try?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.22,0:40:03.05,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.81,0:40:06.27,general text,,0,0,0,,You are going to extremes
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.14,0:40:10.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher, come up with a way that will keep me alive and allow me to control energy
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.56,0:40:15.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Basic breathing techniques are passed down from generation to generation
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.07,0:40:17.99,italics,,0,0,0,,Ho Yeom from the So family
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.07,0:40:21.20,general text,,0,0,0,,So, any member of the So family will use the same technique
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.53,0:40:25.70,general text,,0,0,0,,- So Yul\N- So Yul
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.29,0:40:36.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Go ask him. You said you were close
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.59,0:40:38.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul is cautious
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.72,0:40:42.01,general text,,0,0,0,,If I ask, he will understand everything and tell Ho Yeom
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.76,0:40:45.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Just ten breaths...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.26,0:40:47.97,general text,,0,0,0,,No, seven will be enough
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.06,0:40:50.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I can understand by placing my hand on the core of his energy
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.69,0:40:53.86,general text,,0,0,0,,He'll break your arm before he takes a breath
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.52,0:40:57.28,general text,,0,0,0,,You're right, he's not like you
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.61,0:40:59.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.99,0:41:01.99,general text,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.07,0:41:07.45,general text,,0,0,0,,What? What kind of contemptuous look is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.54,0:41:10.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I don’t think I can do to him what I did to you
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.96,0:41:12.42,general text,,0,0,0,,No, no, Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.50,0:41:14.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Look me in the eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.13,0:41:17.46,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s inconvenient for you to touch him, but with me one or two?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.55,0:41:20.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Like a child. Is this important now?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.72,0:41:21.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Child?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.26,0:41:24.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, very important
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.76,0:41:26.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.76,0:41:27.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I am in perfect health
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.68,0:41:30.02,general text,,0,0,0,,- No, let’s say that I’m crazy\N- Well, let me go
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.89,0:41:33.77,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.44,0:41:36.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.36,0:41:41.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Why do you constantly mock Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.99,0:41:43.03,general text,,0,0,0,,She has not recovered yet
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.11,0:41:45.16,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t mock her
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.70,0:41:48.20,general text,,0,0,0,,- What?{\i1}\N- Here's a beetle
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.28,0:41:49.87,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought you were kind
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.20,0:41:52.79,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.67,0:41:57.25,italics,,0,0,0,,Your master demands too much from you, doesn’t he?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.34,0:42:00.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Not only do you look after him, but also entertain him
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.63,0:42:02.84,italics,,0,0,0,,He asks for warm water, but when I bring it,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.92,0:42:04.34,general text,,0,0,0,,asks for a cold one again...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.43,0:42:06.30,general text,,0,0,0,,- Hey, what...{\i1}\N- He says the food is salty,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.39,0:42:08.05,general text,,0,0,0,,but then complains that she is bland
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.14,0:42:10.43,general text,,0,0,0,,- Me?{\i1}\N- He is immature and capricious
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.52,0:42:12.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Lazy, but with high self-esteem
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.77,0:42:15.06,italics,,0,0,0,,But what can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.15,0:42:16.44,general text,,0,0,0,,He is my master,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.52,0:42:18.48,general text,,0,0,0,,so I have to serve him
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.15,0:42:21.48,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, it seems you managed to learn a lot about him
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.57,0:42:22.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm ashamed of you
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.07,0:42:28.12,general text,,0,0,0,,By the way, what are you doing here? Why aren't you in Sejukwon?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.87,0:42:34.50,general text,,0,0,0,,We came to Yul
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.58,0:42:35.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok asked me to come
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.21,0:42:39.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.17,0:42:42.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Why don’t you approach him then?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.01,0:42:45.13,general text,,0,0,0,,We spied on him
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.72,0:42:49.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok was embarrassed to approach him,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.43,0:42:50.56,general text,,0,0,0,,so I stayed with her
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.73,0:42:57.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, you probably like Yul
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.23,0:42:59.23,general text,,0,0,0,,- No...{\i1}\N- Dan Gu,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.31,0:43:01.19,general text,,0,0,0,,you grasp everything quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.27,0:43:03.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I was already embarrassed
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.19,0:43:06.61,general text,,0,0,0,,- Master! There was a misunderstanding\N- Don’t be shy
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.70,0:43:09.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Many girls like Yul
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.70,0:43:11.37,italics,,0,0,0,,- Your feelings are normal{\i0}\N- This is not...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.45,0:43:13.58,italics,,0,0,0,,I will help Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.66,0:43:15.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk, go to the reception
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.33,0:43:16.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.12,0:43:18.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Ho wants to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.25,0:43:19.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Ho?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.40,0:43:49.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you calling me
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.24,0:43:52.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.87,0:43:55.37,italics,,0,0,0,,The sound of your cough is pleasant and clear
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.45,0:43:57.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I think you feel much better
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.29,0:43:59.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm still dizzy and nauseous
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.33,0:44:01.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm losing consciousness
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.50,0:44:05.00,general text,,0,0,0,,But thanks to you I’m getting better
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.09,0:44:07.17,italics,,0,0,0,,I saw you and your maid
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.26,0:44:11.09,general text,,0,0,0,,had fun walking this morning
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.18,0:44:12.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Isn’t it strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.89,0:44:15.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, stand here
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.68,0:44:18.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I need to take something from you
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.31,0:44:21.15,italics,,0,0,0,,But first
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.86,0:44:23.77,general text,,0,0,0,,I brought something for you
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.61,0:44:26.57,general text,,0,0,0,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.24,0:44:28.99,general text,,0,0,0,,In childhood
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.07,0:44:31.32,general text,,0,0,0,,I let a flock of sheep into your garden with medicinal herbs
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.41,0:44:33.16,general text,,0,0,0,,I know you hate me since then
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.24,0:44:36.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Those sheep ate medicinal herbs
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.00,0:44:38.91,general text,,0,0,0,,and live to this day
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.00,0:44:41.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Despite this, you saved my life
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.37,0:44:44.29,general text,,0,0,0,,and allowed to live. I am deeply grateful to you for this
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.38,0:44:46.55,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a real idiot,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.63,0:44:49.72,general text,,0,0,0,,but it seems you have learned to show gratitude
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.80,0:44:51.84,general text,,0,0,0,,I have prepared something for you
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.43,0:44:53.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Maiden Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.66,0:45:19.25,general text,,0,0,0,,This wine is made from melt water from the island of volcanoes in South Deho
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.33,0:45:22.54,general text,,0,0,0,,The best dark wine in Deho territory
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.13,0:45:26.34,general text,,0,0,0,,The gentleman said that he wanted to thank you,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.42,0:45:29.88,general text,,0,0,0,,so I had to put in a lot of effort to get it
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.59,0:45:36.18,general text,,0,0,0,,This is a rare delicacy
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.56,0:45:42.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Is there only one bottle?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.57,0:46:00.29,general text,,0,0,0,,You definitely know a lot about gratitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.62,0:46:04.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Servant Kim, you raised him well
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.96,0:46:06.42,italics,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.96,0:46:08.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Bring it here, more quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.13,0:46:10.55,italics,,0,0,0,,What a joy
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.22,0:46:16.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Three bottles?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.68,0:46:22.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.48,0:46:25.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Uka energy gates opened
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.56,0:46:30.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Up to this point, we could not do anything because of the Gwangju order
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.07,0:46:35.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Does this mean that now we can accept him into the family?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.74,0:46:39.33,general text,,0,0,0,,This guy broke off his engagement after using you
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.24,0:46:41.66,general text,,0,0,0,,And you still love him?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.74,0:46:44.62,general text,,0,0,0,,I used it for my own purposes
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.12,0:46:47.58,general text,,0,0,0,,The gate of his energy was closed, and I used it against him,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.67,0:46:49.38,general text,,0,0,0,,forcing him to live with us
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.46,0:46:51.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t twist the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.13,0:46:54.51,general text,,0,0,0,,He said that he would live with us if we help him open the gates of energy
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.59,0:46:55.93,general text,,0,0,0,,So he seduced you
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.22,0:47:01.06,general text,,0,0,0,,In the end it happened
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.14,0:47:04.27,general text,,0,0,0,,If you had opened his gates then,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.35,0:47:06.44,general text,,0,0,0,,you would have a son-in-law,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.52,0:47:10.65,general text,,0,0,0,,and I would marry the one I want
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.98,0:47:14.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.99,0:47:17.49,general text,,0,0,0,,The son of the Chan family, whose energy gates are open,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.57,0:47:19.74,general text,,0,0,0,,will never be my son-in-law
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.12,0:47:23.87,general text,,0,0,0,,You must take your sister's place
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.66,0:47:27.71,general text,,0,0,0,,and become the head who protects Jinyeowon for the sake of the family
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.38,0:47:31.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Find a man who will support you
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.38,0:47:35.13,general text,,0,0,0,,If my sister had not died,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.92,0:47:38.09,general text,,0,0,0,,I would marry my beloved
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.10,0:47:46.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry, mom
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.69,0:47:52.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Check whether Gwigu's urn has been collected or not
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.48,0:47:54.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.61,0:48:45.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk broke Gwigu's urn
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.62,0:48:52.79,general text,,0,0,0,,What if I ask him to marry me in return?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.75,0:48:55.17,general text,,0,0,0,,He will definitely refuse
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.09,0:49:04.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yul sleeps in the farthest room?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.97,0:49:08.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, he loves peace and quiet
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.89,0:49:11.39,general text,,0,0,0,,When does he go to bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.89,0:49:13.35,general text,,0,0,0,,If it is not busy,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.44,0:49:16.65,general text,,0,0,0,,early to bed and early to rise
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.03,0:49:19.07,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.15,0:49:21.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you want to visit his bedroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.41,0:49:24.49,general text,,0,0,0,,No matter how much you like him, this is wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.54,0:49:28.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Hint
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.87,0:49:31.79,general text,,0,0,0,,He always eats at the same time, you can see him at lunch
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.00,0:49:34.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.33,0:49:37.63,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,I need more than to see. I need to touch it
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.27,0:49:56.86,general text,,0,0,0,,We're Doc, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.90,0:50:02.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.20,0:50:07.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Outsiders are not allowed to read books in Jeongjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.53,0:50:10.91,general text,,0,0,0,,She only helps
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.00,0:50:12.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, and spells are written in them
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.96,0:50:14.83,general text,,0,0,0,,She still won’t understand
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.71,0:50:17.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.30,0:50:20.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know martial arts?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.88,0:50:26.64,general text,,0,0,0,,I learned to dance in the gisaeng house
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.81,0:50:31.43,general text,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm fast
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.77,0:50:38.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is Don Yi? Gotta ask something
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.48,0:50:44.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Don And is not here, but there is Mu Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.99,0:50:47.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, help him
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.45,0:50:48.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I will help
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.82,0:50:50.83,general text,,0,0,0,,No need
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.13,0:51:09.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Help, young master?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.06,0:51:15.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Sir, are you hungry? What to bring?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.60,0:51:20.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Sir, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.74,0:51:36.33,general text,,0,0,0,,The magicians of Chonjingak live here. Don't follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.75,0:51:45.13,voiceover,,0,0,0,,If he goes to bed early, it means he’s going to bed
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.77,0:52:00.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this a restroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.49,0:52:10.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you to leave. Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.45,0:52:17.87,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought maybe I could help with something
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.91,0:52:19.75,general text,,0,0,0,,To you
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.17,0:52:22.79,general text,,0,0,0,,do you need something from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.88,0:52:30.51,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Just to touch you. And this is a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.39,0:52:34.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you follow me all the way to the men's room?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.13,0:53:11.34,voiceover,,0,0,0,,This is my chance. Six breaths and I will understand how he breathes
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.22,0:53:15.18,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,One
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.31,0:53:17.14,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Two
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.02,0:53:21.19,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Three
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.89,0:53:23.02,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Four
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.20,0:53:40.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.83,0:53:43.00,voiceover,,0,0,0,,I was so close
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.08,0:53:45.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I know that you and Uk were looking at me from afar
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.25,0:53:46.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you following me?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.09,0:53:50.55,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Just one breath
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.59,0:53:52.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Answer
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.22,0:53:54.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.62,0:54:21.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.71,0:54:24.00,general text,,0,0,0,,It hurts
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.14,0:54:43.81,general text,,0,0,0,,You are interested in my breathing technique. Trying to reach the core of my energy
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.56,0:54:46.40,general text,,0,0,0,,I tell you, I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.48,0:54:47.94,general text,,0,0,0,,You lie so skillfully
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.81,0:54:50.82,general text,,0,0,0,,And before there was not dance, but martial arts
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.40,0:54:53.03,general text,,0,0,0,,My life was hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.11,0:54:55.53,general text,,0,0,0,,so I learned a couple of moves for safety
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.61,0:54:57.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this for Uka?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.49,0:55:02.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I think he's trying to control the energy reserve inside
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.50,0:55:05.41,general text,,0,0,0,,But he won’t succeed even with the help of my technique
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.83,0:55:11.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Stop wasting time. Get better and go away
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.07,0:55:32.98,general text,,0,0,0,,So do you remember me,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.98,0:55:35.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.36,0:57:05.12,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t ignore you because I hated you
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.20,0:57:08.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Your mother Do Hwa was like a daughter to me
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.33,0:57:11.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm something like your grandfather
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.96,0:57:15.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Young scoundrel
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.76,0:57:19.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, grandpa
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.84,0:57:27.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Your mother was very kind
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.77,0:57:30.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.73,0:57:34.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes! You should know this
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.31,0:57:37.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Remember this and do not pay attention to other people’s words
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.95,0:57:42.20,general text,,0,0,0,,This poor child...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.28,0:57:49.16,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Length and depth of inhalations and exhalations
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.30,0:58:03.34,general text,,0,0,0,,It's hard to play. I'm impressed
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.84,0:58:06.76,general text,,0,0,0,,I can do a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.43,0:58:09.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Return
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.15,0:58:17.19,general text,,0,0,0,,It seems to be many years old
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.27,0:58:19.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Why do you need something so old?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.57,0:58:25.24,general text,,0,0,0,,It belongs to an old friend
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.37,0:58:34.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Instead of a friend nearby, you have a whistle
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.17,0:58:37.04,general text,,0,0,0,,So your friend left you
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.38,0:58:42.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.38,0:58:44.88,general text,,0,0,0,,This belongs to that friend
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.80,0:58:49.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Give me back, he means a lot to me
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.31,0:58:55.31,general text,,0,0,0,,In return, teach me your breathing technique
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.90,0:59:00.40,general text,,0,0,0,,You said it was useless anyway
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.48,0:59:02.69,general text,,0,0,0,,This is also useless for me
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.49,0:59:04.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's change
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.07,0:59:09.87,general text,,0,0,0,,For me this is garbage,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.83,0:59:12.37,general text,,0,0,0,,I can break it
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.76,0:59:31.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Only three breaths
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.43,1:00:14.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.92,1:00:43.17,general text,,0,0,0,,What kind of facial expression?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.71,1:00:46.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Not like you
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.59,1:00:49.76,general text,,0,0,0,,I like it
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.47,1:00:56.06,general text,,0,0,0,,You twisted everything like that
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.89,1:01:00.31,general text,,0,0,0,,I followed Yul and repeated that I liked him, and now I found out
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.39,1:01:01.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.44,1:01:05.44,general text,,0,0,0,,You are a sensitive person who kills everyone in your path,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.52,1:01:08.78,general text,,0,0,0,,but I decided to flirt with the guy for the sake of my student
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.82,1:01:11.03,general text,,0,0,0,,And you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.11,1:01:13.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I hope you didn't let Ho Yeom take his energy
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.87,1:01:16.20,general text,,0,0,0,,The power is in me. And I learned his breathing technique
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.29,1:01:17.74,general text,,0,0,0,,So you wasted your time
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.83,1:01:20.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you find out? Don't lie to me
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.00,1:01:22.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're lying,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.37,1:01:24.54,general text,,0,0,0,,to pretend that you did something worthwhile
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.63,1:01:26.67,general text,,0,0,0,,I was breathing like this. how is he
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.75,1:01:29.05,general text,,0,0,0,,And, it seems, I felt something moving in me
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.22,1:01:38.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Energy is boiling inside you
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.35,1:01:41.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Worked
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.44,1:01:46.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Were you that close to Yul?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.77,1:01:49.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Caution. I still see the mark in your eyes
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.11,1:01:52.86,general text,,0,0,0,,I used eye drops
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.82,1:01:56.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t see the mark in the mirror. You can see it, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.58,1:01:58.12,general text,,0,0,0,,This is how you look
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.20,1:02:00.16,general text,,0,0,0,,If you really like him, this is how you should approach him
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.25,1:02:02.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Be careful with love
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.79,1:02:05.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Only you can let me in like that
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.75,1:02:10.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay. Now only you can
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.30,1:02:14.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll try not to fall in love with Yulia
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.84,1:02:16.89,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.97,1:02:19.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Why does this require effort?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.77,1:02:21.27,general text,,0,0,0,,He's beautiful
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.35,1:02:24.19,general text,,0,0,0,,It takes effort not to fall in love with a handsome man
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.27,1:02:25.48,general text,,0,0,0,,And me?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.56,1:02:28.73,general text,,0,0,0,,I think it was much more difficult not to fall in love with me
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.82,1:02:29.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Not at all
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.94,1:02:32.82,general text,,0,0,0,,How not? It doesn't make sense
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.90,1:02:35.45,general text,,0,0,0,,- Say it was difficult\N- Yes, master
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.53,1:02:37.28,general text,,0,0,0,,- Say seriously\N - Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.37,1:02:39.20,general text,,0,0,0,,- So will you say that?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.28,1:02:40.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Come on, make me laugh
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.55,1:04:16.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.63,1:04:19.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Judging by the energy on your sword,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.97,1:04:22.72,general text,,0,0,0,,you have mastered the highest degree of Ryusu
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.68,1:04:27.31,general text,,0,0,0,,All thanks to you,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.39,1:04:29.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Deputy Gyeongju
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.98,1:04:32.65,general text,,0,0,0,,The only one who can compete with you,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.73,1:04:34.98,general text,,0,0,0,,I think only Seo Yul from the Seo family
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.82,1:04:39.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Her Majesty the Queen and father Julia, General So, brother and sister
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.57,1:04:41.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul and I were very close as children,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.78,1:04:43.70,general text,,0,0,0,,but everything changed when he entered Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.12,1:04:49.96,general text,,0,0,0,,So Yul, Park Dan Gu, Chan Wook and Jin Cho Young are known
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.04,1:04:51.79,general text,,0,0,0,,like Four Seasons
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.88,1:04:54.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Let them have fun
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.13,1:04:56.05,italics,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.13,1:04:58.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is Chan Wook also among them when he doesn’t have magic?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.80,1:05:01.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Now owns
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.09,1:05:03.51,general text,,0,0,0,,His gates of energy are open
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.30,1:05:05.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Is the gate open?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.27,1:05:11.27,general text,,0,0,0,,But he can’t do much
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.35,1:05:13.77,general text,,0,0,0,,He is the son of Chang Gan, gwangju Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.27,1:05:16.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Recently
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.44,1:05:19.15,general text,,0,0,0,,he came and asked about Nak Su’s sword
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.32,1:05:22.16,general text,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.20,1:05:27.20,memories,,0,0,0,,Are you afraid that I will succeed?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.29,1:05:28.58,italics,,0,0,0,,So you gave it away?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.66,1:05:31.12,general text,,0,0,0,,His Majesty ordered you to keep it in Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.21,1:05:34.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwangju post belongs to the Jang family
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.29,1:05:36.55,general text,,0,0,0,,There was no choice
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.88,1:05:40.51,general text,,0,0,0,,How rude
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.59,1:05:42.47,general text,,0,0,0,,He looks down on me
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.30,1:05:45.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Still, I was his father’s student
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.64,1:05:49.02,general text,,0,0,0,,If you think about it like that, I was not officially his student
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.27,1:05:53.15,general text,,0,0,0,,I had nowhere to go when the Jin family threw me out,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.06,1:05:56.06,general text,,0,0,0,,he took me as a servant
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.86,1:05:59.19,general text,,0,0,0,,You are the teacher of the Crown Prince of this country
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.28,1:06:01.03,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare he?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.11,1:06:02.99,general text,,0,0,0,,It's like looking down on me
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.07,1:06:05.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I apologize for
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.16,1:06:09.29,general text,,0,0,0,,that your teacher does not come from a noble family
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.04,1:06:15.29,general text,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.17,1:06:18.50,general text,,0,0,0,,put Chan Wook in his place
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.15,1:06:41.69,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the sword of Gwangju Chan, to Chan Wook's father
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.20,1:06:44.28,general text,,0,0,0,,I somehow...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.36,1:06:47.74,general text,,0,0,0,,promised to accept him if he exposed
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.49,1:06:50.12,general text,,0,0,0,,his father’s sword
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.20,1:06:52.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Now the gates of his energy are open and this is possible
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.37,1:06:56.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Will you allow him to become the magician of Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.96,1:07:01.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Bring Uka
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.97,1:07:14.23,memories italics,,0,0,0,,What did you say? Who is his father?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.02,1:07:16.44,memories,,0,0,0,,The deceased king
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.81,1:07:19.69,memories,,0,0,0,,He is the son of a king!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.03,1:07:23.65,memories,,0,0,0,,So he is the son of the king,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.57,1:07:27.20,memories,,0,0,0,,who died a year ago?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.78,1:07:29.12,memories,,0,0,0,,The deceased king
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.78,1:07:32.62,memories,,0,0,0,,died due to illness, unable to move
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.70,1:07:33.87,memories,,0,0,0,,How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.95,1:07:35.54,memories,,0,0,0,,On this baby’s birthday,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.50,1:07:39.13,memories,,0,0,0,,the king’s new star shone in the sky
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.75,1:07:43.63,memories,,0,0,0,,The brother of the deceased king has already taken the throne,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.34,1:07:46.47,memories,,0,0,0,,which his son will inherit
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.55,1:07:49.68,memories,,0,0,0,,If the royal family finds out that this is the king's son,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.55,1:07:52.39,memories,,0,0,0,,they will perceive it
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.52,1:07:54.81,memories,,0,0,0,,as a threat
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.94,1:08:02.40,memories italics,,0,0,0,,His existence will bring chaos
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.40,1:08:06.03,memories italics,,0,0,0,,He should not attract attention to himself
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.03,1:08:10.53,memories italics,,0,0,0,,People must think that there is nothing unusual about him
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.29,1:08:18.00,general text,,0,0,0,,I sincerely apologize
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.67,1:08:21.25,general text,,0,0,0,,for all the problems that I created
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.84,1:08:25.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor decided
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.55,1:08:28.30,general text,,0,0,0,,open the gates of your energy,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.01,1:08:30.68,general text,,0,0,0,,therefore the responsibility does not lie with you
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.22,1:08:34.18,general text,,0,0,0,,I, Chan Wook, the eldest son of the Chan family,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.26,1:08:36.06,general text,,0,0,0,,ready to learn and practice
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.89,1:08:39.27,general text,,0,0,0,,If Sosnovy Bor gives me a chance, I will do my best
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.52,1:08:42.65,general text,,0,0,0,,As a sign of your loyalty,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.73,1:08:45.57,general text,,0,0,0,,I will give you the sword Nak Su, which I took from Jin Mu,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.40,1:08:48.15,general text,,0,0,0,,so that it is stored in the Sosnovy Bor armory
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.91,1:08:52.28,general text,,0,0,0,,No need
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.70,1:09:00.46,general text,,0,0,0,,The sword belongs to the Chan family, let it be kept with you
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.21,1:09:10.43,general text,,0,0,0,,You can take your father's sword
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.89,1:09:15.97,general text,,0,0,0,,From now on, I forbid Chan Wook from entering Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.02,1:09:23.61,general text,,0,0,0,,You are free to come,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.15,1:09:26.73,general text,,0,0,0,,like the son of an old friend
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.78,1:09:32.70,general text,,0,0,0,,But you do not have the right to become a magician of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.07,1:09:35.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Now
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.83,1:09:39.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook will not have access to anything in the forest
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.67,1:09:46.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Give me the amulet that allows you to pass here
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.97,1:09:53.22,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t have it
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.01,1:09:54.84,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.81,1:09:58.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm lost
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.85,1:10:02.02,general text,,0,0,0,,spirit amulet
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.10,1:10:04.60,general text,,0,0,0,,What punishment is provided for those
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.56,1:10:07.27,general text,,0,0,0,,who will lose the amulet?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.53,1:10:10.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Spanking, 100 blows, master
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.61,1:10:13.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I give Chan Wook one hundred blows
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.28,1:10:15.32,general text,,0,0,0,,for the loss of the amulet
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.86,1:10:54.32,general text,,0,0,0,,He has the energy of Master Ho, everything will be fine
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.90,1:10:57.74,general text,,0,0,0,,If you get in, he will have more problems
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.29,1:11:44.37,italics,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, leave Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.45,1:11:46.46,general text,,0,0,0,,and don’t appear here again
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.34,1:11:52.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Go away
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.38,1:11:55.67,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.76,1:11:56.80,general text,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.63,1:11:58.84,general text,,0,0,0,,I can’t leave like this
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.51,1:12:02.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I was hit 99 times
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.56,1:12:05.98,general text,,0,0,0,,One hit left
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.52,1:12:10.02,general text,,0,0,0,,And this last one
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.69,1:12:13.11,general text,,0,0,0,,apply it yourself
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.87,1:12:32.04,memories,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to keep him safe
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.63,1:12:36.38,memories,,0,0,0,,If his gates of energy are not opened, and he lives like my son, he will survive
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.46,1:12:39.59,memories,,0,0,0,,But if he decides to try his luck,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.80,1:12:43.93,memories,,0,0,0,,death awaits him
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.66,1:13:03.70,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Uk, just give up
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.99,1:13:06.95,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,and live quietly
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.04,1:13:10.67,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,This is the only way you will survive
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.95,1:13:42.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.37,1:13:45.87,general text,,0,0,0,,take the sword
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.94,1:14:19.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Leaving
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.71,1:15:18.08,preview,,0,0,0,,I want to bare it and show them
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.17,1:15:19.96,preview,,0,0,0,,- Is this a manifestation of stupidity?\N- No, strength
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.04,1:15:21.05,preview,,0,0,0,,Stand your ground
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.13,1:15:23.26,preview,,0,0,0,,There is another sword that you cannot draw
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.34,1:15:26.09,preview,,0,0,0,,But it belongs to his father
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.18,1:15:28.43,preview,,0,0,0,,I have to pick him up
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.51,1:15:30.43,preview,,0,0,0,,Whoever wins takes it
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.51,1:15:33.56,preview,,0,0,0,,Going against the prince is a manifestation of stupidity
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.64,1:15:37.06,preview,,0,0,0,,But some believe that this is a show of force. I have to try
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.10,1:15:40.82,preview,,0,0,0,,My student is too weak to fight against you
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.77,1:15:43.48,preview,,0,0,0,,He needs to be put in danger again
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.24,1:15:46.65,preview,,0,0,0,,And he will get what he wants
